# LootAdvisor - PUBLIC repo. No extracted game files; they are rebuilt locally from the
# player's own BG3 install (README "Rebuild"). Allowed: our code, the mod source (LootAdvisor/Mods, Public, Localization),
# tests, own art, the package sources (package/: INSTALL.md, Media/). Built paks and packages never: they go to dist/.

# local builds: dist/LootAdvisor.pak, the player package dist/LootAdvisor/ and its zip
dist/

# game-derived data: loca/stats/level dumps, extracted item lists, scores with game item texts
data/cache/
data/items_all/*
!data/items_all/SCHEMA.md
data/scores/

# generated pages that embed game icons/texts (sets.html, previews), captures, audit shots
artifact/

# extracted game textures/icons (frames_game, icons, mapicons, minimapicons, sheets) and outputs made from them;
# the generator stays
design/*
!design/make_rainbow.py

# downloaded third-party tools, never committed
third_party/

# save/profile snapshots, in-game screenshots (incl. stray shot.sh files at the root)
backups/
shots/
/shots$*

# built paks, wherever they turn up
*.pak

# game texture formats and models, wherever they turn up outside the mod source
*.dds
*.DDS
!/LootAdvisor/Mods/**/*.dds
!/LootAdvisor/Mods/**/*.DDS
!/LootAdvisor/Public/**/*.dds
!/LootAdvisor/Public/**/*.DDS
*.glb
*.gr2
*.GR2

# python / node / editor clutter
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
.cache/
*.mp4
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Script Extender IDE helpers (README "Lua tooling"), fetched locally
.ide/
